  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of a Resource Center for Returnees from Western European Countries and Other Marginalized Categories of Individuals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to establish resource center in Shuto Orizari, a model that will offer practical and most direct ways for cooperation between citizens and relevant governmental institutions. This project is part of a larger regional project &#x201c;Strengthen national and local systems to support the effective socio-economic integration of returnees in the Western Balkans&#x201d; implemented in North Macedonia, Albania and Serbia and led and coordinated by the UNDP&#x2019;s Istanbul Regional Hub.</narrative>
  </description>
